        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Christopher Townsend\n- Works: Iron Man 3, Guardians of the Galaxy Vol.\n- Awards: BAFTA, Academy Award for Best Visual Effects\n- Organizations: Marvel Studios, Walt Disney Studios Motion Pictures, Marvel Comics\n\nFacts:\n- Iron Man 3 is a 2013 American superhero film based on the Marvel Comics character Iron Man.\n- Iron Man 3 was produced by Marvel Studios and distributed by Walt Disney Studios Motion Pictures.\n- Christopher Townsend was nominated for a BAFTA and an Academy Award for Best Visual Effects for his work on Iron Man 3.\n- Christopher Townsend was the overall supervisor for Guardians of the Galaxy Vol.",
